+| RQ03 Preserve earlier wording/conflicts | Six exact public Git-blob snapshots under frozen/; no source or prior report overwritten | SHA256 checks and local four-baseline preservation pass; original2second/text-image conflicts remain unadjudicated |
+| RQ04 Keep evidence independent/traceable | Explicit passes, objections, source versions and unrun tests; SOURCE-DEPENDENCE.json | Historical input independence and causal tests remain open |
+| RQ05 Eligible AveLyra publication | Public-safe original research and already-public snapshots only | Commit/ref/account/blob evidence belongs in the dated publication receipt; this checklist alone asserts no successful push |
+| RQ06 Carry unresolved work forward | README next-record list; EM02/03/04/06 open joins | No raw-data replication or overall completion claimed |
+| RQ07 Audit our own explanations | EM07 corrects our prior Millette link; EM05 prevents turning source-access gaps into event reversals | Source exists and matches pinned hash; earlier answer remains preserved |
+
+This supplement closes documentation defects only to the stated extent. It does not replace the published134-entry baseline, the original16tasks or five supplemental task contracts. The substantive editor has not yet adopted these audit-side proposals. PDF/source-image verification is separate from the text diff. Current publication status requires its own actual check, not an inferred label in a frozen document.
